  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi all，</p><p>【映客527】活动已上线，活动时间2026年5月15日-5月27日，现同步活动Day7数据。</p><p><strong class=\"font-semibold\">一、完成情况：</strong></p><p>活动目标：活动钻石消耗达2.16e钻石</p><p>截至5月21日，活动消耗达5616万钻石，目标完成度为26.00%，日期进度53.85%。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 145.6pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.4pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>目标</td><td>消耗</td><td>完成度</td><td>日期进度</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>216,000,000</td><td>56,162,465</td><td>26.00%</td><td>53.85%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>活动消耗占比大盘消耗的20.83%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的34.95%；</p><p>其中普通礼物消耗3909万钻，非礼物消耗655万钻，特殊礼物消耗1052万钻。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 145.6pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.4pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 119.6pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 98.8pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 62.4pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 109.2pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>日期</td><td>总消耗</td><td>礼物消耗</td><td>功能消耗</td><td>活动合计</td><td>礼物墙消耗</td><td>非礼物消耗</td><td>特殊礼物消耗</td><td>活动礼物占比</td><td>活动占大盘比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,515</td><td>40,100,727</td><td>22,283,652</td><td>17,817,075</td><td>8,677,857</td><td>6,484,413</td><td>0.00%</td><td>2,193,444</td><td>21.64%</td><td>21.64%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,516</td><td>35,911,762</td><td>18,824,800</td><td>17,086,962</td><td>9,154,305</td><td>6,017,237</td><td>1,562,638</td><td>1,574,430</td><td>21.14%</td><td>25.49%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,517</td><td>32,181,754</td><td>13,989,902</td><td>18,191,852</td><td>6,550,287</td><td>4,096,594</td><td>1,475,243</td><td>978,450</td><td>15.77%</td><td>20.35%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,518</td><td>44,310,742</td><td>22,673,151</td><td>21,637,591</td><td>12,937,447</td><td>9,951,438</td><td>1,168,013</td><td>1,817,996</td><td>26.56%</td><td>29.20%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,519</td><td>32,559,837</td><td>16,324,053</td><td>16,235,784</td><td>4,926,483</td><td>2,602,726</td><td>933,163</td><td>1,390,594</td><td>12.26%</td><td>15.13%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,520</td><td>51,558,884</td><td>31,263,849</td><td>20,295,035</td><td>8,698,997</td><td>6,526,940</td><td>664,895</td><td>1,507,162</td><td>15.58%</td><td>16.87%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,521</td><td>32,973,570</td><td>16,592,046</td><td>16,381,524</td><td>5,217,089</td><td>3,407,737</td><td>748,286</td><td>1,061,066</td><td>13.55%</td><td>15.82%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>合计</td><td>269,597,276</td><td>141,951,453</td><td>127,645,823</td><td>56,162,465</td><td>39,087,085</td><td>6,552,238</td><td>10,523,142</td><td>18.40%</td><td>20.83%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>日均</td><td>38,513,897</td><td>20,278,779</td><td>18,235,118</td><td>8,023,209</td><td>5,583,869</td><td>936,034</td><td>1,503,306</td><td>18.40%</td><td>20.83%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong class=\"font-semibold\">二、专属礼物消耗</strong></p><p>截至5月21日，专属礼物累计消耗4961万钻。消耗TOP礼物为幻梦乐园753万钻、如意金箍652万钻、鲸云星河459万钻、魔法七彩花401万钻、星穹王座400万钻。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 145.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 119.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 98.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 62.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 109.2pt;\" /><col /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物名称</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">20260515</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">20260516</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">20260517</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">20260518</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">20260519</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">20260520</td><td>20,260,521</td><td>合计<